      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Write suitable words to complete the conversation.</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/exams/set_3_-_customs_and_traditions_2_420583d0.png\" alt width=\"500\"></p>\n<p>Tom: Have you ever been to a traditional festival, Mia?</p>\n<p>Mia: Yes, I went to one last year. It was amazing! There was a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-899789-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-899789-0' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899789-0' /></span></strong> on the river.</p>\n<p>Tom: That sounds fun! Did you do anything else?</p>\n<p>Mia: Yes, as a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-899789-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-899789-1' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899789-1' /></span></strong>, I joined a special activity where people released a duck into the water at Kensington Gardens Park.</p>\n<p>Tom: Really? Why do they do that?</p>\n<p>Mia: It&#8217;s part of the tradition. It&#8217;s supposed to bring good luck.</p>\n<p>Tom: Sounds interesting! Was the festival well-organized?</p>\n<p>Mia: It was, but sadly, <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-899789-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-899789-2' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899789-2' /></span></strong> threw <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-899789-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-899789-3' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899789-3' /></span> </strong>everywhere after it finished. It was such a mess.</p>",
