      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Drag and drop to complete the text.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><img src=\"/images/exams/set_2_-_customs_and_traditions_minh_hoa_d0945ef0.png\" alt width=\"300\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In some cultures, special traditions are followed during important celebrations. On these days, people often <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><input id='fbo-899965-0' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-899965-0' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899965-0' /></span></strong> early to prepare food and decorations. For example, one common dish is <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><input id='fbo-899965-1' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-899965-1' type='text' size='18' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899965-1' /></span></strong>, which is a symbol of good fortune and happiness. Families gather together to enjoy a delicious meal.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In certain festivals, there are unique activities that carry special <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><input id='fbo-899965-2' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-899965-2' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899965-2' /></span></strong>. One interesting custom is to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-899965-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-899965-3' type='text' size='16' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899965-3' /></span></strong> into a lake or river. People believe that this act brings peace and harmony to the family.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">During these celebrations, people also like to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.5</label><input id='fbo-899965-4' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='4' name='fbo-899965-4' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899965-4' /></span></strong> to enjoy fireworks, music, and dance in the streets. It&#8217;s a joyful time when everyone feels connected to their culture and history. These traditions are not just about food or fun but also about respecting the past and creating memories with loved ones. They remind people of the importance of family and community.</p>",
